<w:wordDocument xmlns:w="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2003/wordml" xmlns:wx="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2003/auxHint" w:macrosPresent="no"><w:body><w:p><w:r><w:t>PROJECT 41-2287 — LEGACY SCREENER (Word 2003 format)</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>S1. Do you or does anyone in your household work in market research? IF YES, TERMINATE (T1).</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>S2. Which of these age bands are you in? SINGLE CODE. TERMINATE if under 18 (T2).</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:body></w:wordDocument>